<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib50.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">arXiv preprint arXiv:2507.15225</em>, 2025b.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib51" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zimmer et al. (2025)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Matthieu Zimmer, Xiaotong Ji, Rasul Tutunov, Anthony Bordg, Jun Wang, and Haitham Bou Ammar.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Bourbaki: Self-generated and goal-conditioned mdps for theorem proving.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib51.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">arXiv preprint arXiv:2507.02726</em>, 2025.

</span></li>
    
