</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Algorithm</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The complete algorithm is presented across multiple blocks for clarity and modularity. Algorithm <a href="#alg1" title="Algorithm 1 ‣ A.1 Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Hilbert: Recursively Building Formal Proofs with Informal Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a> provides the main entry point and high-level control flow, while Algorithm <a href="#alg2" title="Algorithm 2 ‣ A.1 Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Hilbert: Recursively Building Formal Proofs with Informal Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> details the subgoal resolution strategies. Algorithms <a href="#alg3" title="Algorithm 3 ‣ A.1 Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Hilbert: Recursively Building Formal Proofs with Informal Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> and <a href="#alg4" title="Algorithm 4 ‣ A.1 Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Hilbert: Recursively Building Formal Proofs with Informal Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> focus on sketch generation, validation, and assembly processes. Algorithm <a href="#alg5" title="Algorithm 5 ‣ A.1 Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Hilbert: Recursively Building Formal Proofs with Informal Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> contains the core proof generation functions that interface with different LLM components, while Algorithm <a href="#alg6" title="Algorithm 6 ‣ A.1 Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Hilbert: Recursively Building Formal Proofs with Informal Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> specifies the prompt-based functions for various reasoning tasks. Algorithm <a href="#alg7" title="Algorithm 7 ‣ A.1 Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Hilbert: Recursively Building Formal Proofs with Informal Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> handles error correction and refinement procedures, and Algorithm <a href="#alg8" title="Algorithm 8 ‣ A.1 Algorithm ‣ Appendix A Appendix ‣ Hilbert: Recursively Building Formal Proofs with Informal Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> provides supporting functions for theorem retrieval and verification.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
