<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg3.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 3</span> </span> <span id="alg3.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Hilbert</span>: Sketch Validation and Refinement</figcaption>
<div id="alg3.6" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
