              <span id="alg8.l37.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg8.l37.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg8.l38" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">38:</span>
              
              
              <span id="alg8.l38.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <span id="alg8.l38.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">existing_theorems</span>

</div>
<div id="alg8.l39" class="ltx_listingline">
