<span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:42.49em;">
<span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:446.1pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">The following Lean 4 code has compilation errors. Please fix the errors while</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p" style="width:446.1pt;"><span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:446.1pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">maintaining the mathematical meaning.</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p" style="width:446.1pt;"><span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:446.1pt;"></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.4" class="ltx_p" style="width:446.1pt;"><span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:446.1pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{error_message}</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.5" class="ltx_p" style="width:446.1pt;"><span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:446.1pt;"></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.6" class="ltx_p" style="width:446.1pt;"><span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:446.1pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Instructions:</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.7" class="ltx_p" style="width:446.1pt;"><span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:446.1pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">1. Analyze what the theorem is trying to prove. Then, analyze why the error is</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.8" class="ltx_p" style="width:446.1pt;"><span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:446.1pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">   happening, step-by-step. Add a brief explanation.</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.9" class="ltx_p" style="width:446.1pt;"><span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:446.1pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">2. Then, provide a corrected version of the Lean 4 code that addresses these</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p" style="width:446.1pt;"><span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:446.1pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">   specific errors.</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p" style="width:446.1pt;"><span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:446.1pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">3. Do NOT include any other Lean code blocks except for the proof.</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p" style="width:446.1pt;"><span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:446.1pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">4. Do NOT use sorry.</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p" style="width:446.1pt;"><span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:446.1pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">5. Do NOT include any imports or open statements.</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p" style="width:446.1pt;"><span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:446.1pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">6. Do NOT change anything in the original theorem statement.</span></span>
<span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.15" class="ltx_p" style="width:446.1pt;"><span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_inline-block" style="width:446.1pt;"></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.16" class="ltx_p" style="width:446.1pt;"><span id="A1.SS2.p13.pic1.2.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:446.1pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">{useful_theorems_section}</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
